sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant C as Controller
  participant S as OfferPlanningService
  participant R as OfferModelRegistry
  participant D as DriverRepository
  participant P as ModelOfferPolicy
  Client->>C: POST /offer-plans
  C->>C: Validate body (400 on failure)
  C->>S: createPlan(route, drivers)
  S->>R: current() read once
  R-->>S: models, policy, modelVersion
  S->>S: Market supported? (422 if not)
  S->>S: Drop duplicate driver ids
  S->>D: findByIds(driver ids)
  D-->>S: known drivers
  S->>S: Drop market mismatches
  S->>S: Any candidates left? (422 if not)
  S->>P: plan(route, candidates)
  P-->>S: OfferPlan
  S-->>C: plan, excludedDrivers, modelVersion
  C-->>Client: 200 JSON
